    "Name": "Sturmfeur",
    "Details": "Released in 3149, the Sturmfeur (Fuel Cell) is an updated copy of the original 3018 tank. Swapping to a 340 Fuel Cell allowed designers to increase the tanks speed to 64 km/h and still haul around the same level of armor protection; though the updated model makes the switch to Heavy Ferro-Fibrous with CASE'd ammunition magazines. The original LRM-20's are swapped for ClanTech versions with Artemis IV FCS installed though the designers chose to keep the original model machine guns.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       350     45\n<b>Left</b>         350     45\n<b>Right</b>       350     45\n<b>Rear</b>        275     45\n<b>Turret</b>      330     45\n\n<b>Total</b>      1655    225</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color>",
    "Icon": "Sturmfeur"
  },
  "YangsThoughts": "It's a tank, Boss, they all look the same to me.",
